// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 2
window.T2_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"bloody – communication","cards":[{"w":"bloody","p":"adj.","d":"covered with, stained with, or characterized by much bloodshed and violence","c":"流血的；血腥殘酷的","s":"The two neighboring countries fought a long and bloody war that caused thousands of innocent civilian casualties.","t":"這兩個相鄰的國家進行了一場漫長且血腥殘酷的戰爭，造成了數千名無辜平民的傷亡。"},{"w":"blood","p":"n.","d":"the red fluid that circulates through the heart, arteries, and veins","c":"血液；血統（不可數）","s":"Healthy citizens are warmly encouraged to donate blood at the local medical center to help save lives in emergencies.","t":"當局熱情鼓勵健康的公民到當地醫療中心捐血，以協助在緊急情況中拯救生命。"},{"w":"bleed","p":"v.","d":"to lose blood from the body through a cut or injury","c":"流血；失血（動詞）","s":"The deep cut on Jerry's hand would not stop bleeding after he accidentally broke the glass pitcher.","t":"在傑瑞不小心打破玻璃水壺後，他手上深長的傷口便血流不止持續流血。"},{"w":"bleed sb. dry","p":"v.phr.","d":"to drain someone of all their money, financial resources, or strength","c":"榨乾某人的血汗錢；使某人傾家蕩產","s":"The corrupt business manager made several risky bad investments that completely bled the small company dry.","t":"那名貪腐的業務經理進行了幾次高風險的不良投資，徹底榨乾掏空了這家小公司的所有資產。"},{"w":"brick","p":"n.","d":"a small rectangular block of fired clay used extensively in building structures","c":"磚塊；磚（可數）","s":"Most of the historic residential houses built during the nineteenth century were constructed out of sturdy red brick.","t":"十九世紀建造的大多數歷史悠久的住宅都是由堅固的紅磚砌成。"},{"w":"brunch","p":"n.","d":"a late morning meal eaten instead of both breakfast and lunch","c":"早午餐（不可數/可數）","s":"Rachel loves to wake up late on Sunday mornings and have a relaxing brunch with her mother.","t":"瑞秋喜歡在星期天早晨睡晚一點，然後和母親一起享用輕鬆的早午餐。"},{"w":"bucket","p":"n.","d":"a roughly cylindrical open container with a handle, used for carrying liquids","c":"水桶；提桶（可數）","s":"Tom filled the large plastic bucket with warm water and soap powder so that he could mop the kitchen floor.","t":"湯米在大塑膠水桶裡裝滿了溫水和肥皂粉，以便他能拖乾淨廚房地板。"},{"w":"a drop in the bucket","p":"n.phr.","d":"a very tiny, insignificant amount compared with what is actually needed","c":"九牛一毛；滄海一粟；微不足道","s":"The more foreign knowledge I absorb, the more I humbly feel like my understanding is just a drop in the bucket.","t":"我吸收的外國知識越多，我越謙遜地感到自己的理解不過是九牛一毛／滄海一粟。"},{"w":"chip","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of electronic material with circuits; a crisp thin slice of potato","c":"晶片；洋芋片；小碎片（可數）","s":"This tiny electronic chip installed inside your smartphone is what allows you to connect to mobile networks.","t":"安裝在你智慧型手機內部的這個微小電子晶片，就是讓你能夠連接到行動網路的關鍵。"},{"w":"chip","p":"v.","d":"to break off small pieces from something hard, or to cut away with a tool","c":"弄出缺口；鑿／切掉碎片（動詞）","s":"During freezing winter mornings, Canadian drivers often have to chip thick ice off their car windshields before commuting.","t":"在冰凍的冬日清晨，加拿大駕駛人常常得先將汽車擋風玻璃上的厚冰鑿除才能通勤。"},{"w":"circus","p":"n.","d":"a traveling show of acrobats, trained animals, and clowns in a large tent","c":"馬戲團；熱鬧喧囂的場面（可數）","s":"The funny clowns and talented acrobats in the traveling circus made all the young children laugh out loud.","t":"巡迴馬戲團中滑稽的小丑與才華洋溢的雜技演員讓所有年幼的孩子大聲歡笑。"},{"w":"clip","p":"n.","d":"a small device for holding things together; a short extract from a film or broadcast","c":"夾子；迴紋針；剪輯短片（可數）","s":"The secretary neatly attached the important legal document to the application file with a shiny paper clip.","t":"秘書用一個光亮的迴紋夾將重要的法律文件整齊地附在申請檔案上。"},{"w":"clip","p":"v.","d":"to fasten with a clip; to cut off with scissors or shears","c":"用夾子夾住；修剪；剪下（動詞）","s":"My grandfather spends every Saturday morning using sharp gardening shears to clip the bushes in the garden.","t":"我祖父每週六早晨都花時間使用鋒利的園藝剪刀修剪花園裡的灌木。"},{"w":"clue","p":"n.","d":"a piece of evidence or information that helps solve a puzzle or mystery","c":"線索；端倪；提示（可數）","s":"City police detectives returned to the dark crime scene to look for any hidden clue about the mystery.","t":"市警局的偵探們返回黑暗的犯罪現場，尋找有關這起懸案的任何隱藏線索。"},{"w":"not have a clue","p":"v.phr.","d":"to be completely ignorant or have no knowledge or idea about something","c":"毫無頭緒；一無所知","s":"I honestly do not have a clue about why the two close coworkers have been arguing all morning.","t":"我對於這兩位平時親密的同事為何整整一個上午都在爭吵完全毫無頭緒。"},{"w":"communicate","p":"v.","d":"to share or exchange information, news, or ideas with others","c":"溝通；交流；傳達（動詞）","s":"Because our family members live in different overseas countries, we communicate mostly by weekly video calls and text messages.","t":"因為我們全家人住在不同的海外國家，我們主要透過每週的視訊通話和文字訊息來聯絡／溝通。"},{"w":"communication","p":"n.","d":"the imparting or exchanging of information by speaking, writing, or using other media","c":"溝通；交流；通訊（不可數/可數）","s":"Maintaining honest and open communication is the most important foundation for building a successful long-term relationship.","t":"保持坦誠且公開的溝通是建立成功長期關係最重要的基石。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"cupboard – historical","cards":[{"w":"cupboard","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture with shelves and doors, used for storing cups, dishes, or food","c":"碗櫥；壁櫥；食櫥（可數）","s":"The delicate ceramic coffee cups and glass bowls are neatly organized in the top kitchen cupboard.","t":"精緻的陶瓷咖啡杯和玻璃碗整齊地收納在廚房最上方的碗櫥中。"},{"w":"dare","p":"v.","d":"to have enough courage to do something risky or frightening","c":"敢於；膽敢；激…去做","s":"I dare you to jump into the cold lake water and swim to the other side.","t":"我激／向你挑戰敢不敢跳進冰冷的湖水中游到對岸。"},{"w":"dare","p":"n.","d":"a challenge to someone to do something risky as a proof of courage","c":"激將；冒險挑戰（可數）","s":"The naughty young boy climbed the tall tree simply on a dare from his adventurous classmates.","t":"那個調皮的小男孩只是因為冒險同學的一時激將／挑戰就爬上了高樹。"},{"w":"dash","p":"v.","d":"to run or move somewhere quickly or in a great hurry","c":"急奔；猛衝；急馳","s":"Cindy realized she was late for school, so she quickly dashed out of the house to catch the bus.","t":"辛蒂發現自己上學快遲到了，於是她快速衝出家門去搭公車。"},{"w":"dash","p":"n.","d":"a quick run or sudden movement; a short sprint race; a punctuation mark (-)","c":"猛衝；短跑；破折號（可數）","s":"As soon as the thunder cracked loudly, the beach visitors made a sudden dash for their cars.","t":"雷聲一巨響，海灘上的遊客立刻向他們的汽車猛衝過去。"},{"w":"elevator","p":"n.","d":"a moving platform or cage for carrying passengers from one floor to another","c":"電梯；升降機（可數，美式）","s":"Because the modern apartment building has thirty floors, residents rely completely on the speedy elevator every day.","t":"因為這棟現代化公寓大樓有三十層樓，住戶每天完全依賴那部快速電梯。"},{"w":"escalator","p":"n.","d":"a moving staircase consisting of an endlessly circulating belt of steps","c":"電扶梯；自動扶梯（可數）","s":"Shoppers carrying heavy grocery bags prefer to take the moving escalator between the basement and the first floor.","t":"提著沉重購物袋的顧客偏好搭乘地下室與一樓之間的電扶梯。"},{"w":"flock","p":"n.","d":"a group of birds or sheep living or traveling together","c":"（鳥、羊等動物的）群（可數）","s":"Early in the morning, a noisy flock of white seagulls flew gracefully over the sandy ocean coast.","t":"大清早，一大群喧鬧的白海鷗優雅地飛越沙灘海岸。"},{"w":"flock","p":"v.","d":"to gather or move together in large crowds or swarms","c":"成群結隊湧向；蜂擁而至","s":"During the hot summer holiday, thousands of tourists flock to the refreshing cool mountain lakes for relaxation.","t":"在炎熱的暑假期間，數千名遊客成群湧向令人心曠神怡的涼爽高山湖泊放鬆。"},{"w":"foggy","p":"adj.","d":"full of or obscured by thick mist or fog; confused or unclear","c":"有濃霧的；多霧的；模糊不清的","s":"Driving on the winding mountain roads was extremely hazardous on that cold and foggy winter morning.","t":"在那個寒冷且多霧的冬日清晨，在蜿蜒的山路上開車極其危險。"},{"w":"fog","p":"n.","d":"a thick cloud of tiny water droplets suspended in the atmosphere at ground level","c":"霧；濃霧（不可數/可數）","s":"Flight departures at the international airport were delayed for three hours due to thick morning fog.","t":"由於清晨的濃霧，國際機場的航班起飛延誤了三個小時。"},{"w":"follower","p":"n.","d":"a person who moves along behind; an admirer or supporter of a person, group, or belief","c":"追隨者；信徒；社群粉絲（可數）","s":"The talented young fashion model gained over two hundred thousand new online followers on Instagram this month.","t":"那位才華洋溢的年輕時裝模特兒這個月在 Instagram 上增加了二十多萬名新粉絲／追隨者。"},{"w":"follow","p":"v.","d":"to go or come after a person or thing; to obey a rule or advice","c":"跟隨；遵守；關注（動詞）","s":"Every driver on the expressway is strictly required to follow all speed limits to ensure public safety.","t":"高速公路上的每位駕駛人都被嚴格要求遵守所有速限，以確保大眾安全。"},{"w":"fund","p":"n.","d":"a sum of money saved or provided for a specific purpose","c":"資金；基金；專款（可數/不可數）","s":"The community school organized a charity bake sale to raise necessary funds for new library computers.","t":"社區學校舉辦了一場慈善烘焙義賣，為圖書館的新電腦籌措必要的資金。"},{"w":"fund","p":"v.","d":"to provide with money for a project, institution, or activity","c":"資助；為…提供資金（動詞）","s":"The national education ministry decided to generously fund the new science laboratory at our high school.","t":"國家教育部決定慷慨資助我們高中的新科學實驗室。"},{"w":"historian","p":"n.","d":"an expert who studies and writes about past events and civilizations","c":"歷史學家（可數）","s":"The knowledgeable university historian spent twenty long years investigating the political causes of the ancient civil war.","t":"那位博學的大學歷史學家花了整整二十年調查那場古代內戰的政治成因。"},{"w":"historic","p":"adj.","d":"famous or important in history; having great historical significance","c":"具歷史意義的；歷史性的；名留青史的","s":"Signing the international environmental treaty was widely praised as a truly historic moment for global cooperation.","t":"簽署這份國際環境條約被廣泛讚譽為全球合作真正的歷史性時刻。"},{"w":"historical","p":"adj.","d":"concerning past events, history, or the study of history","c":"有關歷史的；歷史上的；史學的","s":"Before writing her award-winning book, the dedicated author conducted extensive historical research in national archives.","t":"在撰寫她那本獲獎著作之前，這位盡責的作家在國家檔案館進行了廣泛的歷史研究。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"jail – passage","cards":[{"w":"jail","p":"n.","d":"a place for the confinement of people convicted of or awaiting trial for a crime","c":"監獄；看守所（可數/不可數）","s":"The convicted bank robber was sentenced to spend five long years in jail for his violent crimes.","t":"那名被定罪的銀行搶犯因其暴力罪行被判處在監獄中度過漫長的五年。"},{"w":"jail","p":"v.","d":"to put someone in prison or jail as a legal punishment","c":"監禁；關押；下獄（動詞）","s":"If a corrupt official is found guilty of accepting massive bribes, the judge will certainly jail him.","t":"如果貪腐官員被判定收受巨額賄賂有罪，法官肯定會將他收押下獄。"},{"w":"jet","p":"n.","d":"a fast airplane powered by one or more jet engines; a rapid stream of liquid or gas","c":"噴射客機；噴射機；噴射氣流（可數）","s":"The wealthy international businessman travels across the world in his luxurious private jet for important meetings.","t":"那位富有的跨國商人搭乘他豪華的私人噴射客機飛往世界各地參加重要會議。"},{"w":"jet lag","p":"n.phr.","d":"extreme tiredness felt by a person after a long flight across multiple time zones","c":"時差綜合症；時差反應；時差疲勞（不可數）","s":"After flying for fourteen consecutive hours from Taipei to New York, Susan suffered from terrible jet lag for three days.","t":"從台北連續飛行十四個小時抵達紐約後，蘇珊飽受嚴重時差反應之苦長達三天。"},{"w":"jet","p":"v.","d":"to travel quickly by airplane, especially a jet","c":"搭乘噴射機快速旅行；噴出（動詞）","s":"Immediately after the emergency summit concluded, the French president jetted from New York back to Paris.","t":"緊急高峰會一結束，法國總統便立刻搭乘噴射專機從紐約飛回巴黎。"},{"w":"joyful","p":"adj.","d":"feeling, causing, or expressing great happiness and delight","c":"喜悅的；充滿歡樂的；令人高興的","s":"The proud parents shed joyful tears when their eldest daughter walked across the stage to graduate.","t":"當大女兒走過講台畢業時，引以為傲的父母流下了喜悅的淚水。"},{"w":"joy","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of great pleasure and happiness; a source of delight","c":"喜悅；樂趣；歡樂（不可數/可數）","s":"Welcoming their healthy newborn baby into the loving home brought immense joy to the entire family.","t":"歡迎他們健康的初生寶寶進入這個充滿愛的家，為全家人帶來了莫大的喜悅。"},{"w":"leopard","p":"n.","d":"a large solitary wild cat with a yellowish-fawn coat with black spots","c":"豹；花豹（可數）","s":"The stealthy African leopard hid quietly in the tall tree branches, waiting patiently for a gazelle to pass below.","t":"那隻隱密的非洲花豹安靜地躲在高高的樹枝上，耐心地等待下方的瞪羚經過。"},{"w":"mall","p":"n.","d":"a large enclosed shopping area containing many diverse stores, eateries, and entertainment","c":"大型購物中心；購物商城（可數）","s":"On rainy weekend afternoons, teenagers in our neighborhood enjoy gathering at the modern indoor shopping mall.","t":"在下雨的週末午後，我們社區的青少年喜歡聚集在現代化的室內購物商場。"},{"w":"media","p":"n.","d":"the main means of mass communication regarded collectively (plural of medium)","c":"大眾傳播媒體（複數名詞，單數為 medium）","s":"The famous murder trial attracted intense global attention, resulting in massive and sensational media coverage worldwide.","t":"那場著名的謀殺審判引起了全球高度關注，引發了全世界廣大且聳動的媒體報導。"},{"w":"operation","p":"n.","d":"a surgical procedure; the act of functioning; a large organized activity","c":"手術；營運；軍事／商業行動（可數/不可數）","s":"The skilled neurosurgeon took four tense hours to successfully perform a delicate brain operation on the patient.","t":"那位技術精湛的腦神經外科醫師花了緊張的四個小時，成功為病人進行了精細的腦部手術。"},{"w":"operate","p":"v.","d":"to control the functioning of a machine; to perform a surgical procedure","c":"操縱；運作；動手術（動詞）","s":"Every new factory worker must undergo thorough safety training before being allowed to operate the heavy equipment.","t":"每位新工廠工人都必須接受徹底的安全培訓，才被允許操作重型設備。"},{"w":"operational","p":"adj.","d":"in or ready for use; concerning the routine functioning of an organization","c":"運作中的；操作上的；業務上的","s":"After months of rigorous safety testing, the city's new solar power plant is finally fully operational.","t":"經過數月嚴格的安全測試，該市的新太陽能發電廠終於完全投入運作。"},{"w":"palace","p":"n.","d":"the official residence of a sovereign, archbishop, or other exalted person","c":"宮殿；皇宮（可數）","s":"Millions of curious tourists travel to London every summer to watch the changing of the guard at Buckingham palace.","t":"每年夏天數百萬好奇的遊客前往倫敦，在白金漢宮觀看衛兵交接儀式。"},{"w":"passage","p":"n.","d":"a narrow way allowing access between buildings or rooms; an excerpt from a book; the passing of time","c":"通道；走廊；篇章；流逝（可數/不可數）","s":"A brightly lit underground passage connects the busy subway station directly to the basement of the department store.","t":"一條燈光明亮的地下通道將繁忙的地鐵站直接連接至百貨公司的地下室。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"pat – rectangle","cards":[{"w":"pat","p":"v.","d":"to touch someone or something gently and quickly with the flat surface of the hand","c":"輕拍；撫拍（動詞）","s":"When Emily stepped out of the bath, she used a soft cotton towel to pat her face dry.","t":"當艾蜜莉洗完澡出來時，她用一條柔軟的棉毛巾將臉部輕拍吸乾。"},{"w":"pat","p":"n.","d":"a quick, gentle tap with the flat of the hand; a small shaped mass of butter","c":"輕拍；輕撫；一小塊（奶油）（可數）","s":"She felt a gentle and comforting pat on her shoulder, and turning around, she saw her best friend smiling.","t":"她感到肩膀上傳來一記溫柔且安慰的輕拍，轉過身來，看見她最好的朋友正微笑著。"},{"w":"pat oneself on the back","p":"v.phr.","d":"to praise or congratulate oneself for an achievement or good deed","c":"自我稱讚；為自己感到自豪","s":"After completing the complicated financial report ahead of the strict deadline, you really should pat yourself on the back.","t":"在嚴格的截止日前提前完成了這份複雜的財務報告，你真的應該好好稱讚自己／為自己喝采。"},{"w":"pause","p":"v.","d":"to stop an action, speech, or process temporarily before starting again","c":"暫停；停頓（動詞）","s":"Please pause the streaming movie for a minute so I can get a glass of water from the kitchen.","t":"請先將線上串流電影暫停一分鐘，好讓我去廚房倒一杯水喝。"},{"w":"pause","p":"n.","d":"a temporary stop in action or speech; a button that pauses playback","c":"停頓；暫停；暫停鍵（可數）","s":"There was an awkward pause in the room while the speaker tried desperately to remember what to say next.","t":"當演講者拼命試圖想起接下來要講什麼時，整個房間陷入了一陣尷尬的停頓中斷。"},{"w":"peanut","p":"n.","d":"an oval edible seed that develops in pods underground and is used for snacks and oil","c":"花生；花生米（可數）","s":"Because my younger brother is severely allergic to peanuts, our family never buys cookies containing nuts.","t":"因為我弟弟對花生嚴重過敏，我們家從不購買含有堅果的餅乾。"},{"w":"pilot","p":"n.","d":"a person qualified to operate the flying controls of an aircraft or direct a ship","c":"飛行員；機長；領航員（可數）","s":"Despite the severe typhoon winds, the highly experienced airline pilot landed the commercial aircraft safely at the airport.","t":"儘管遭遇強烈的颱風風力，經驗極其豐富的民航機長／飛行員依然將客機安全降落在機場。"},{"w":"pilot","p":"v.","d":"to act as a pilot of an aircraft or boat; to guide or lead","c":"駕駛（飛機／船隻）；引導；引領（動詞）","s":"Debbie has been studying aviation theory and hopes to learn how to pilot a light airplane this summer.","t":"黛比一直在研讀航空理論，並希望今年夏天能學習如何駕駛一架輕型飛機。"},{"w":"pilot","p":"adj.","d":"done as a small-scale trial, test, or experiment before full introduction","c":"試驗性的；試點的；試辦的","s":"Before introducing the new cancer medicine nationwide, hospital researchers conducted a careful pilot study on fifty volunteer patients.","t":"在全國推廣這款抗癌新藥之前，醫院研究人員在五十名志願病患身上進行了審慎的試驗性前導研究。"},{"w":"pineapple","p":"n.","d":"a large juicy tropical fruit with tough spiky skin and sweet yellow flesh","c":"鳳梨；菠蘿（可數/不可數）","s":"Whenever foreign friends visit Taiwan, they always buy delicious traditional pineapple cakes as souvenirs for their families.","t":"每當外國朋友來台灣旅遊時，他們總是會購買美味的傳統鳳梨酥作為伴手禮送給家人。"},{"w":"raw","p":"adj.","d":"not cooked; in a natural state and not yet processed or treated","c":"生的；未烹煮的；未加工的；原始的","s":"Because James has a sensitive stomach, he strictly avoids eating raw seafood and never goes to sushi bars.","t":"因為詹姆斯的胃腸很敏感，他嚴格避免吃生的海鮮，而且從不去壽司店。"},{"w":"receiver","p":"n.","d":"the part of a telephone that you hold to your ear and mouth; an electronic device that receives radio or TV signals; a recipient","c":"電話話筒；接收器；收件人（可數）","s":"Felix held the telephone receiver between his ear and shoulder so that he could use both hands to type.","t":"費利克斯將電話話筒／聽筒夾在耳朵和肩膀之間，以便他能用雙手打字。"},{"w":"recorder","p":"n.","d":"an electronic apparatus for recording sound or video; a woodwind musical instrument with finger holes","c":"錄音機；記錄器；木笛／直笛（可數）","s":"The investigative reporter placed a compact digital voice recorder on the table to record the interview accurately.","t":"那位調查記者在桌上放置了一台精巧的數位語音錄音機，以便準確記錄訪談內容。"},{"w":"rectangle","p":"n.","d":"a four-sided plane figure with four straight sides and four right angles, especially with unequal adjacent sides","c":"長方形；矩形（可數）","s":"The official soccer field is a massive green rectangle with white boundary lines marked clearly across the grass.","t":"正式的足球場是一個巨大的綠色長方形，草地上清晰標記著白色邊界線。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"remind – yell","cards":[{"w":"remind","p":"v.","d":"to cause someone to remember someone or something","c":"提醒；使想起；使記起（動詞）","s":"Please remind me to turn off all the classroom lights and lock the front door before we head home.","t":"在我們回家之前，請提醒我關掉教室裡所有的電燈並鎖上前門。"},{"w":"reminder","p":"n.","d":"a thing that causes someone to remember something, such as a note or notice","c":"提醒物；提示信；提示備忘錄（可數）","s":"The bank sent an email reminder reminding customers to pay their credit card balances before the due date.","t":"銀行寄出了一封電子郵件提醒通知，提醒顧客在截止日前繳納信用卡餘額。"},{"w":"scale","p":"n.","d":"an instrument for weighing; the relative size, extent, or degree of something; a series of marks","c":"磅秤；秤盤；規模；等級；比例尺（可數）","s":"Before checking your heavy travel baggage at the airport, weigh each suitcase carefully on the digital scale.","t":"在機場托運沉重的行李前，請先在電子磅秤上仔細秤量每個行李箱。"},{"w":"scale","p":"v.","d":"to climb up or over something high and steep; to adjust in size or proportion","c":"攀登；登上（險峰）；按比例縮放","s":"Equipped with strong climbing ropes and ice axes, the adventurous mountaineers hoped to scale the icy north peak.","t":"裝備了堅固的登山繩索和冰斧，那些勇於冒險的登山客希望能攀登登上冰封的北峰。"},{"w":"stale","p":"adj.","d":"no longer fresh, pleasant, or edible; dull, unoriginal, and lacking new ideas","c":"不新鮮的；走味的；陳腐老套的","s":"If you leave the sliced loaf of bread on the kitchen counter uncovered, it will quickly turn hard and stale.","t":"如果你把切片麵包隨意敞開放在廚房流理台上，它很快就會變硬且不新鮮。"},{"w":"trader","p":"n.","d":"a person who buys and sells goods, currency, or stocks as a business","c":"商人；交易商；證券交易員（可數）","s":"My experienced stock trader advised me to wait for a market dip before investing in technology shares.","t":"我那位經驗豐富的證券交易員／操盤手建議我等市場回檔後，再行投資科技股。"},{"w":"trade","p":"n.","d":"the action of buying and selling goods and services; a particular job requiring manual skills","c":"貿易；商業；行業（不可數/可數）","s":"Rapid growth in overseas shipping has greatly expanded international trade between Asian and European nations.","t":"遠洋海運的迅速發展極大拓展了亞洲與歐洲國家之間的國際貿易。"},{"w":"trade","p":"v.","d":"to buy and sell goods or services; to exchange one thing for another","c":"買賣；進行交易；互相交換（動詞）","s":"During lunchtime at school, the friendly boys often trade their fruit snacks and sandwiches with each other.","t":"在學校吃午餐時，那些友善的男孩子們常常彼此交換水果點心和三明治。"},{"w":"trademark","p":"n.","d":"a symbol or word legally registered to represent a company; a distinctive characteristic","c":"商標；標誌；特徵（可數）","s":"The world-famous beverage company has protected its distinctive golden bottle logo as a registered trademark.","t":"這家世界著名的飲料公司已將其獨特的金色瓶身標誌保護為註冊商標。"},{"w":"yell","p":"v.","d":"to give a loud, sharp cry or scream, typically of pain, anger, or excitement","c":"大叫；吼叫；大喊（動詞）","s":"Even when you feel extremely frustrated during a workplace dispute, you should never yell at your coworkers.","t":"即使在職場爭議中感到極度沮喪，你也絕不應該對你的同事大聲吼叫。"},{"w":"yell","p":"n.","d":"a loud, sharp cry or shout of excitement, terror, or pain","c":"叫喊聲；吶喊；吼叫（可數）","s":"When the scary haunted house door suddenly banged shut, the terrified girl let out a loud yell.","t":"當恐怖鬼屋的門突然砰地關上時，受驚嚇的女孩發出了一聲響亮的尖叫喊聲。"}]}];
